tree-sitter-vba: vendored from https://github.com/tmepple/tree-sitter-vba
at commit c691f237b2a703732d4b6a1f01d5b4f73f94d41e.
The vendored src/grammar.json is byte-identical to that commit's;
src/parser.c, src/node-types.json and the src/tree_sitter/ headers are generated from it by the
pinned tree-sitter CLI (0.25.10, scripts/regen-vendored-parsers.py), and CI checks that.

Upstream ships no LICENSE file and states no copyright notice. It declares
the MIT License in package.json, Cargo.toml and tree-sitter.json, and
tree-sitter.json names its author as "Todd Epple".
This directory is used under those terms. The license text follows without a
copyright line, because upstream states none.

